OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fdry overnight with an increasing
OL,7,Fsoutheasterly wind that will become
OL,8,Fstrong at times near the coast.
OL,9,FBecoming cold, with a patchy frost
OL,10,Fdeveloping towards dawn. Wind light
OL,11,Fbut breezy along the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FCloudy and grey on Friday with
OL,14,Frain spreading east through the day.
OL,15,FChilly, especially by night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
